9. TLA⁺ Specification of the Safe-State Machine

9.1 Module Decomposition

The specification is decomposed into four composable modules:

CCL_Quorum.tla specifies the weighted Byzantine quorum protocol. Authorization depends explicitly on quorum certificates:

QuorumCertificate(Q) == Σ_{i∈Q} Weight[i] ≥ Theta ∧ Card(Q) ≥ 1

Authorized(X, t) == ∃ Q : QuorumCertificate(Q) ∧ ∀ i ∈ Q : Signed(i, X, t)

